+ * Sber edition: animated wallpapers the launcher draws itself, chosen in Launcher settings as "live:&lt;scene&gt;".
+ * Each scene is a few layers painted once into bitmaps (half the screen's resolution, stretched with filtering) and
+ * then only moved, scaled or faded, so the GPU recomposes textures and nothing is redrawn frame by frame. The motion
+ * runs only while Home is in front (start and stop), and not at all with reduced motion.
